00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:55.340
stop clicking altogether. Every row that's
ready fires on its own all at once. Now

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:00.600
watch the cascade. The moment a row's
domain lands, its score becomes eligible

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:06.800
and starts running. Each row moves through
the stages on its own. Runs finish in

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.700
their own time, and every result settles
in next to the data that produced it.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:18.100
From here, the table takes care of itself.
Type in a new company, and the whole

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:22.120
